# Desktop UI

Style spec: `BentoDocs/Impl/desktop-ui-style.md`. Tokens live in `apps/bento_desktop/src/styles/light.css`.

- Chrome (window shell, modal): `.chrome`. Top bar lives inside the same chrome — do not nest another `.chrome` or `.glass`.
- Content tiles (HostCard, Config columns): `.iridescent-border` only — opaque `--surface`, no blur.
- Content (type, fields, lists, logs, badges, buttons): Flat 2.0. Use `Button` for primary/danger actions.
- Iridescence is atmosphere and edges only. Glow is for selected/focus/hover, not neon.
- No Neumorphism, no page-wide Glassmorphism, no dark cyber HUD.
- Use CSS variables from `light.css`. Do not hardcode hex in components.
- Primary actions: solid `--accent`. Deny/destructive: `--danger` outline.
- Tool names, namespaces, JSON: `--font-mono`.
